    "Every addon is asked at the same time, as when you press Play, each for three films and three episodes in turn. Every request is a real lookup, so the test only runs when you start it. Your own loads keep the times up to date.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every addon is asked at the same time, as when you press Play, each for three films and three episodes in turn. Every request is a real lookup, so the test only runs when you start it. Your own loads keep the times up to date."
          }
        }
      }
    },
