    "Optional. A TMDB Read Access Token adds TMDB scores and episode ratings. Credentials stay in the Keychain. Site links work without keys.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional. A TMDB Read Access Token adds TMDB scores and episode ratings. Credentials stay in the Keychain. Site links work without keys."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. IMDb scores for titles come from the ratings file on this device, with no key. An OMDb key adds the IMDb score of each episode, one request per season, made when its first episode card comes on screen. The free key allows 1,000 lookups a day. TMDB uses a Read Access Token. Credentials stay in the Keychain. Site links work without keys.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional. IMDb scores for titles come from the ratings file on this device, with no key. An OMDb key adds the IMDb score of each episode, one request per season, made when its first episode card comes on screen. The free key allows 1,000 lookups a day. TMDB uses a Read Access Token. Credentials stay in the Keychain. Site links work without keys."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. OMDb adds Rotten Tomatoes and Metacritic scores; TMDB uses a Read Access Token. Credentials stay in the Keychain. Site links work without keys.": {
