    "Saved titles, watched marks and paused positions sync both ways automatically. Removing a saved title or clearing a watched mark here does the same on Trakt, and what is removed on Trakt is removed here. Saved titles use your Trakt watchlist; your collection is only read. Sync reads everything from Trakt again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved titles, watched marks and paused positions sync both ways automatically. Removing a saved title or clearing a watched mark here does the same on Trakt, and what is removed on Trakt is removed here. Saved titles use your Trakt watchlist; your collection is only read. Sync reads everything from Trakt again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
